## 实现细节

### 步骤1: 创建嵌入脚本
修改Makefile或创建脚本, 将必要的.wasm文件转换为C数组:
```bash
xxd -i modules/shell/shell.wasm > build/shell_wasm.h
# 或使用ld的binary格式:
ld -r -b binary -o build/shell_embed.o modules/shell/shell.wasm
```

### 步骤2: 更新wasm_registry
修改kernel/wasm_host.c中的wasm_registry:
```c
extern const uint8_t _binary_modules_shell_shell_wasm_start[];
extern const uint8_t _binary_modules_shell_shell_wasm_end[];

static wasm_registry_entry_t wasm_registry[] = {
    { "init",           init_wasm_bytes, init_wasm_size },
    { "shell",          _binary_modules_shell_shell_wasm_start,
                        (_binary_modules_shell_shell_wasm_end - _binary_modules_shell_shell_wasm_start) },
    // ... 其他模块
};
```

### 步骤3: 修改Makefile
添加.wasm到.o的嵌入规则:
```makefile
# 将每个.wasm转换为binary o文件
build/shell_embed.o: modules/shell/shell.wasm
    ld -r -b binary -o $@ $<
```
将embed o文件加入LD_SRCS

### 步骤4: 清理
- 移除不再需要的ramdisk .wasm副本
- 保留ramdisk用于普通文件(配置文件等)

